WEBVTT

01:30.460 --> 01:34.950
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.240 --> 01:37.810
[Episode 19]

02:00.660 --> 02:01.460
Could it be

02:03.000 --> 02:05.330
that the Immortal Lord has lost her power?

02:15.580 --> 02:17.110
The Immortal Lord has lost.

02:17.310 --> 02:18.710
The Realm of Mist and Void

02:19.120 --> 02:20.520
no longer exists.

02:21.670 --> 02:23.400
We knew that once you made it out,

02:23.400 --> 02:26.000
the first thing you'd do would be
to come and settle scores with us.

02:26.000 --> 02:27.300
So we came to you instead.

02:27.300 --> 02:29.280
Now that we've all lost our powers,

02:29.430 --> 02:30.960
let's see if your bare hands

02:31.170 --> 02:32.829
can stand against our swords.

03:07.020 --> 03:09.070
We were previously deceived by
the Dreamshard Immortal.

03:09.070 --> 03:10.710
We apologize for the offense.

03:10.710 --> 03:12.750
It was also under Dreamshard's pressure

03:12.750 --> 03:14.410
that we tortured you, My Lord.

03:14.480 --> 03:17.680
Please understand our situation
and forgive us, My Lord.

03:19.150 --> 03:20.350
Your face has healed?

03:21.250 --> 03:21.710
Yes.

03:36.780 --> 03:39.380
Now that you've returned to
your mortal forms,

03:39.620 --> 03:42.240
come back with me to
the capital of Tiansheng Kingdom.

03:42.240 --> 03:44.190
I will report everything
that happened here

03:44.190 --> 03:46.230
truthfully to His Majesty.

03:46.840 --> 03:48.430
As for your punishment,

03:49.870 --> 03:51.870
that'll be His Majesty's decision.

03:52.850 --> 03:53.920
Thank you, My Lord.

03:54.470 --> 03:55.270
You may leave.

04:10.980 --> 04:12.840
Is the Immortal Lord really dead?

04:19.600 --> 04:20.810
Should I be glad...

04:23.190 --> 04:24.430
Or should I be sad?

04:32.430 --> 04:33.360
You are free now.

04:36.430 --> 04:38.159
Before the Immortal Lord died,

04:39.050 --> 04:40.460
did she ever ask about me?

04:44.530 --> 04:46.860
She never once intended to take your life.

04:48.390 --> 04:50.790
Perhaps that is what
she wished to tell you.

05:09.520 --> 05:10.940
Unparalleled beauty,

05:12.270 --> 05:13.580
immortality—

05:16.750 --> 05:17.800
all of it was nothing

05:17.800 --> 05:20.040
but an imagined mirage.

05:21.040 --> 05:22.500
This Realm of Mist and Void

05:22.940 --> 05:25.800
was born from
Dreamshard's illusory obsessions.

05:28.070 --> 05:29.670
Now that Dreamshard is gone,

05:30.190 --> 05:32.120
the false has all been burned away,

05:33.070 --> 05:34.630
and the real is revealed.

06:01.280 --> 06:03.810
So this is the Immortal Lord's
crystal heart?

06:05.840 --> 06:06.770
I never expected

06:07.350 --> 06:09.950
it would be hidden here
amidst this flower sea.

06:17.390 --> 06:19.320
You failed to find the Yuli Spring.

06:19.990 --> 06:21.720
Will His Majesty punish you?

06:23.620 --> 06:24.950
My conscience is clear.

06:25.960 --> 06:27.690
His Majesty will see the truth.

06:29.690 --> 06:30.830
Slaying the Spirit

06:32.909 --> 06:34.050
is also a merit.

06:34.280 --> 06:36.340
That merit cannot be counted as mine.

06:41.670 --> 06:42.740
Xiao Yao was right.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.040
In terms of skill,

06:45.350 --> 06:47.010
I lost to the demons this time.

06:47.830 --> 06:48.890
But no matter what,

06:49.310 --> 06:50.909
I must not lose my integrity.

06:57.080 --> 06:58.810
You care a lot about Xiao Yao...

07:01.350 --> 07:02.880
I mean, about what she says.

07:04.880 --> 07:06.210
Although she's usually

07:06.590 --> 07:08.120
willful and unrestrained,

07:08.850 --> 07:10.650
when it comes to right and wrong,

07:11.400 --> 07:12.730
she's never ambiguous.

07:13.780 --> 07:16.040
Perhaps I was too eager to avenge Tan'er,

07:17.090 --> 07:19.220
too intent on eradicating the demons,

07:19.990 --> 07:22.720
that I ended up losing sight of
my own principles.

07:26.110 --> 07:29.970
If even someone like you is considered
to have lost their principles,

07:30.840 --> 07:32.370
then what does that make me?

07:35.460 --> 07:36.860
I didn't mean it that way.

07:37.250 --> 07:38.909
When Dreamshard brought you to the island,

07:38.909 --> 07:40.110
you were still young.

07:40.470 --> 07:41.240
Of course you cannot

07:41.240 --> 07:44.370
be compared to Xiao Yao,
who grew up in the martial world.

07:52.480 --> 07:54.210
This is the first time I've seen

07:54.560 --> 07:55.960
you blush, Demon Slayer.

08:00.130 --> 08:01.590
This is also the first time

08:02.080 --> 08:03.210
I've seen you smile.

08:13.550 --> 08:14.950
After we reach the shore,

08:16.080 --> 08:17.210
what are your plans?

08:25.610 --> 08:27.870
I'll first go pay respects to my brother.

08:36.360 --> 08:36.840
Okay.

09:11.270 --> 09:12.060
Dali.

09:12.720 --> 09:14.450
The sunlight is abundant here.

09:14.630 --> 09:17.100
You can feel the vital energies

09:17.130 --> 09:19.530
of the sun and the moon,
of heaven and earth.

09:20.680 --> 09:22.010
Cultivate diligently,

09:22.600 --> 09:23.750
and in a few decades,

09:24.200 --> 09:25.860
you'll take human form again.

09:26.930 --> 09:29.730
When that time comes,
let's be good friends again.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.500
Little Leaf.

09:31.630 --> 09:33.240
Grow well here too.

09:34.310 --> 09:36.920
One day, when you cultivate into
a towering tree,

09:36.920 --> 09:37.830
no one will dare

09:38.270 --> 09:39.530
bully you again.

09:44.080 --> 09:45.410
What do you mean by that?

09:46.300 --> 09:48.460
I could feel what you did to Little Leaf

09:48.810 --> 09:50.320
on Mount Qiansui.

09:54.820 --> 09:55.920
What did I do?

09:56.980 --> 09:58.070
I just

09:58.720 --> 09:59.980
used it as a slingshot.

10:00.200 --> 10:02.060
And that was just to please Zixiu.

10:02.910 --> 10:03.960
As the mighty Demon Lord,

10:03.960 --> 10:05.150
how can you be so petty?

10:05.150 --> 10:06.440
-You're really petty.
-Alright, alright.

10:06.440 --> 10:07.500
So sharp-tongued.

10:07.550 --> 10:09.550
I can never win an argument with you.

10:14.600 --> 10:15.360
Hungry, huh?

10:17.220 --> 10:18.750
I'll make you some noodles.

10:40.030 --> 10:41.630
How could you be so careless?

10:42.240 --> 10:43.040
It's nothing.

10:43.820 --> 10:44.870
Go rest over there.

10:44.870 --> 10:48.000
You've just barely recovered
from your serious injury.

10:49.790 --> 10:50.390
Don't worry.

10:50.390 --> 10:52.250
I know how to chop vegetables now.

11:10.000 --> 11:11.600
How about you go wait outside?

11:11.600 --> 11:13.000
It's too cramped in here.

11:13.740 --> 11:15.000
I could use more space.

11:40.520 --> 11:41.550
Come on, take this.

11:41.550 --> 11:42.150
Take this.

11:48.390 --> 11:50.510
This bowl of noodles
may not be the most delicious,

11:50.510 --> 11:52.380
but I made it with my own hands,

11:52.440 --> 11:53.840
so you must finish it all.

12:00.510 --> 12:01.310
What's wrong?

12:04.840 --> 12:05.420
It's hot.

12:06.040 --> 12:06.790
Put it down!

12:06.790 --> 12:07.790
Put it down quickly!

12:07.790 --> 12:08.920
Touch the earlobes.

12:08.960 --> 12:10.090
Touch the earlobes.

12:31.700 --> 12:34.430
♪ Cliffside streams flow, pine scents
fill my sleeves as I sleep ♪

12:36.050 --> 12:38.710
♪ What year will cranes return?
The moss covers another tower ♪

12:40.380 --> 12:42.920
♪ Brew iced moon springs,
the stone pot brims with sunset glows ♪

12:44.340 --> 12:47.020
♪ Wind sweeps the empty court;
writing the seasons ♪

12:48.870 --> 12:51.610
♪ When wind breaks the best tree,
the swan grows thin with grief ♪

12:52.550 --> 12:54.440
I meant touch your own earlobes.

12:53.090 --> 12:55.800
♪ On the mountains, there's a monologue
in the mountains ♪

12:57.370 --> 13:00.110
♪ Drunk in the pavilion,
vines climb up my sleeves ♪

13:01.700 --> 13:04.050
♪ Smiling with an empty cup;
this heart is the harbor ♪

13:07.910 --> 13:11.000
♪ Cool dew freezes the day,
mist and rain veil the drifting boat ♪

13:12.260 --> 13:15.370
♪ Eternal night won't stay, but thankfully
there are memories to keep ♪

13:16.620 --> 13:19.590
♪ Moon shifts stars, wind stirs
curtains at the window ♪

13:20.900 --> 13:23.690
♪ Waiting only for a glance
from you in this lifetime ♪

13:23.360 --> 13:24.100
You got burned

13:24.100 --> 13:25.620
and didn't even put your hands down.

13:25.290 --> 13:27.820
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

13:26.720 --> 13:28.120
You seem

13:28.120 --> 13:29.260
incredibly smart on the surface,

13:28.850 --> 13:31.850
♪ I brew years of romance
and longing into wine ♪

13:29.630 --> 13:31.630
but why are you completely clueless

13:31.670 --> 13:33.050
when it comes to these simple tasks?

13:33.050 --> 13:36.940
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

13:33.120 --> 13:33.650
This one.

13:38.190 --> 13:40.810
♪ Eternal sorrows end, the broken cocoon
becomes an ark ♪

13:41.240 --> 13:41.790
I...

13:42.020 --> 13:44.840
♪ Holding your hand, we watch
the shifting stars together ♪

13:44.480 --> 13:47.030
Can't seem to use any of
my techniques anymore.

13:45.920 --> 13:49.100
♪ I boil away my worries
with dew and strands of hair ♪

13:50.070 --> 13:54.110
♪ Holding your hand, we roam free
and happy together ♪

13:54.320 --> 13:55.320
It's okay.

13:55.230 --> 13:58.870
♪ Three lives of joy,
growing old with one heart ♪

13:55.320 --> 13:57.610
It must be because you've just barely
recovered from your serious injury

13:57.610 --> 13:59.540
that you can't use them right now.

14:00.840 --> 14:02.900
Give it some time. You'll get better.

14:05.080 --> 14:05.650
Mm.

14:09.110 --> 14:12.270
[Forest Breeze]

14:21.070 --> 14:23.640
[Forest Breeze]

14:21.550 --> 14:23.410
You didn't eat anything earlier.

14:23.840 --> 14:25.170
I made you another bowl.

14:25.960 --> 14:26.480
Try it.

14:31.760 --> 14:34.160
My condition's even worse than I imagined.

14:34.910 --> 14:37.110
I cannot sense even the slightest trace

14:37.750 --> 14:38.910
of spiritual power.

14:41.320 --> 14:44.380
What is the origin of
this Heart-Burning Incantation,

14:44.510 --> 14:46.240
and is there a way to counter it?

14:46.360 --> 14:48.820
This incantation is a forbidden technique.

14:49.550 --> 14:51.880
In the demon realm,
no one has ever used it.

14:52.720 --> 14:55.300
I only heard that
when the Primordial Heavenly Mother

14:55.300 --> 14:58.010
was mending the heavens, she violated
the natural laws of heaven and earth,

14:58.010 --> 15:01.750
and afterward took her own life
with the Heart-Burning Incantation.

15:01.750 --> 15:03.690
Since then, throughout the Three Realms,

15:03.690 --> 15:04.890
no one has known of it,

15:05.790 --> 15:08.050
leaving only the legend of the Sky Stone.

15:08.440 --> 15:09.440
The Sky Stone?

15:10.080 --> 15:10.720
Yes.

15:12.960 --> 15:14.120
The Sky Stone

15:15.390 --> 15:17.320
possesses some mysterious power,

15:18.960 --> 15:20.760
but no one has ever truly seen it.

15:26.360 --> 15:26.910
Don't worry.

15:26.910 --> 15:28.430
There must be a solution.

15:29.150 --> 15:30.830
But before we find it,

15:30.870 --> 15:32.200
promise me one thing:

15:33.270 --> 15:34.730
take good care of yourself

15:35.390 --> 15:36.390
and eat properly.

15:41.510 --> 15:42.030
Okay.

15:43.870 --> 15:45.070
Here, let me feed you.

15:51.160 --> 15:52.490
It's really delicious.

16:08.030 --> 16:08.910
Humans,

16:10.270 --> 16:11.320
and demons alike,

16:12.390 --> 16:14.490
will always face setbacks,

16:15.690 --> 16:18.150
but there's no hurdle
that can't be overcome.

16:18.150 --> 16:20.480
If your grief truly makes you
want to give up,

16:20.480 --> 16:22.010
then I might as well die too.

16:23.600 --> 16:24.800
Don't talk nonsense.

16:29.340 --> 16:30.470
A hundred years ago,

16:31.730 --> 16:33.130
I let the demon clan down.

16:34.440 --> 16:35.570
And 100 years later,

16:36.360 --> 16:37.960
I've become like this,

16:39.870 --> 16:41.870
without knowing when I can recover.

16:42.220 --> 16:43.360
I just feel that

16:44.900 --> 16:47.360
I've failed the people of
the Demons' Valley

16:48.800 --> 16:50.910
and my mission as the Demon Lord.

17:00.480 --> 17:05.530
[Forest Breeze]

17:30.750 --> 17:31.510
Hong Ye,

17:32.830 --> 17:33.960
you're a good demon—

17:35.580 --> 17:38.440
and more than that,
you're an excellent Demon Lord.

17:39.060 --> 17:40.260
Losing your powers

17:40.280 --> 17:41.410
is only temporary.

17:42.350 --> 17:43.240
Trust me.

17:44.350 --> 17:45.680
No matter how hard it is,

17:46.460 --> 17:49.260
I will stay with you
and help you find the Sky Stone.

18:14.960 --> 18:15.850
I'm stronger.

18:16.270 --> 18:17.050
Let me do it.

18:31.350 --> 18:32.570
Such strength

18:32.600 --> 18:33.510
is not needed here.

18:33.510 --> 18:34.510
Save it for later.

18:34.670 --> 18:35.250
Let me.

18:35.880 --> 18:37.770
How could I let you do such rough work?

18:37.770 --> 18:38.700
Let me try again.

18:49.720 --> 18:50.310
Well...

19:05.610 --> 19:07.070
I'll show you the skills I've accumulated

19:07.070 --> 19:09.670
over these years
traveling the martial world.

19:24.670 --> 19:26.000
For thousands of years,

19:26.160 --> 19:28.270
I've always been the one
protecting others.

19:28.270 --> 19:29.600
Never thought that now,

19:29.790 --> 19:31.000
I, an old demon,

19:31.000 --> 19:33.730
would need protection from
a young girl like you.

19:45.070 --> 19:46.110
How beautiful.

19:49.940 --> 19:52.540
Do you know the names of
these constellations?

19:56.010 --> 19:56.830
Humans,

19:57.000 --> 19:59.730
in order to observe the movements
of the sun, moon, and stars,

19:59.730 --> 20:01.530
selected 28 stellar officials,

20:01.710 --> 20:03.090
called the Twenty-Eight Mansions.

20:03.090 --> 20:04.590
And the Twenty-Eight Mansions

20:04.590 --> 20:06.350
are further divided into 4 groups,

20:06.350 --> 20:07.200
namely

20:08.330 --> 20:09.590
Azure Dragon of the East,

20:09.590 --> 20:10.790
White Tiger of the West,

20:10.790 --> 20:11.960
Vermilion Bird of the South,

20:11.960 --> 20:13.760
and Black Tortoise of the North.

20:14.110 --> 20:15.270
And each of these mansions

20:15.270 --> 20:17.030
also has its own specific name.

20:17.470 --> 20:18.070
Look,

20:19.680 --> 20:20.140
that one

20:20.270 --> 20:21.960
is the fifth mansion of Azure Dragon—

20:21.960 --> 20:22.880
Heart, the "Yin" Fox.

20:22.880 --> 20:23.510
That one?

20:26.070 --> 20:26.480
Yes.

20:28.030 --> 20:29.810
I only recognize the Big Dipper,

20:29.810 --> 20:32.020
which I use to navigate at night.

20:32.750 --> 20:33.850
The 7 stars of the Big Dipper

20:33.850 --> 20:35.580
also each have their own names.

20:36.400 --> 20:37.200
That's right.

20:37.830 --> 20:38.600
Dubhe,

20:39.070 --> 20:39.750
Merak,

20:40.440 --> 20:41.160
Phecda,

20:41.510 --> 20:42.160
Megrez,

20:42.590 --> 20:43.270
Alioth,

20:43.440 --> 20:44.030
Mizar,

20:44.310 --> 20:45.140
and Alkaid.

20:46.160 --> 20:47.490
You know so much.

20:48.680 --> 20:49.830
In my spare time from cultivation,

20:49.830 --> 20:50.790
I'd go to the human realm

20:50.790 --> 20:52.350
and pick up some ancient books to read

20:52.350 --> 20:53.400
to pass the time.

20:54.830 --> 20:55.890
That's wonderful.

20:56.550 --> 20:57.680
All my life,

20:57.880 --> 20:59.680
I've only read a few story books,

20:59.830 --> 21:02.030
all about talented scholars
and beautiful ladies.

21:02.030 --> 21:03.030
The characters in those stories

21:03.030 --> 21:05.440
never worried about food or clothing

21:05.750 --> 21:07.310
and just focused on romance.

21:07.310 --> 21:08.170
Meanwhile,

21:08.510 --> 21:09.480
I was starving

21:09.480 --> 21:10.590
while reading about
their romantic affairs.

21:10.590 --> 21:11.480
The more I read those books,
the angrier I became.

21:11.480 --> 21:13.680
So eventually, I stopped reading them.

21:15.110 --> 21:16.040
Let me take over.

21:16.830 --> 21:17.830
I've learned how.

21:46.320 --> 21:47.120
Are you tired?

21:47.160 --> 21:47.980
Take a rest.

21:48.680 --> 21:49.550
I am resting.

22:49.090 --> 22:49.980
You're awake.

22:50.680 --> 22:51.480
Morning.

22:52.680 --> 22:53.480
Good morning.

23:10.440 --> 23:12.440
Let me get you a fresh breakfast.

23:16.760 --> 23:17.510
Have a try.

23:25.120 --> 23:25.890
How is it?

23:26.790 --> 23:27.490
Mmm,

23:28.050 --> 23:28.810
very fresh.

23:32.560 --> 23:33.780
I used to think

23:33.850 --> 23:35.910
that fish could only be eaten cooked.

23:36.000 --> 23:37.400
But once, my father and I

23:37.400 --> 23:39.100
were captured by pirates.

23:39.450 --> 23:41.240
Seeing them eat fish like that,

23:41.440 --> 23:42.550
I realized that fish could actually

23:42.550 --> 23:44.240
be eaten this way.

23:45.350 --> 23:46.070
And then?

23:47.400 --> 23:48.140
Then

23:48.240 --> 23:50.220
I befriended those pirates.

23:50.350 --> 23:52.070
I even learned some

23:52.070 --> 23:53.960
survival rules for the sea from them.

23:53.960 --> 23:54.920
For example,

23:55.110 --> 23:56.440
collecting rainwater,

23:56.590 --> 23:59.450
using mirrors to signal for help,
things like that.

24:00.720 --> 24:01.910
Back in Demons' Valley,

24:01.910 --> 24:03.240
you were also like this.

24:03.550 --> 24:04.950
Nothing could stump you.

24:05.440 --> 24:06.490
It's different.

24:06.550 --> 24:07.880
There are far more good stuff
in Demons' Valley

24:07.880 --> 24:08.990
than they ever had.

24:09.350 --> 24:11.640
And you're far more difficult to deal with
than they were.

24:11.640 --> 24:12.340
However,

24:12.640 --> 24:14.720
you're much more handsome than they were.

24:14.720 --> 24:16.050
I've really lucked out.

24:26.160 --> 24:26.870
Hong Ye,

24:27.160 --> 24:28.880
can I discuss something with you?

24:28.880 --> 24:30.940
Teach me some techniques and spells.

24:31.160 --> 24:32.550
The journey back is long,

24:32.550 --> 24:34.540
and if we encounter danger,

24:34.680 --> 24:36.010
I could also protect us.

24:36.790 --> 24:38.480
I could use the techniques you teach me

24:38.480 --> 24:39.540
to protect us both.

24:43.030 --> 24:43.630
All right.

24:43.920 --> 24:46.030
Let's start with
the Wind-Control Technique then.

24:46.030 --> 24:47.480
How can we make this boat

24:47.480 --> 24:48.310
go faster?

24:58.310 --> 24:59.000
Are you ready?

24:59.000 --> 24:59.500
Yes.

25:16.020 --> 25:18.830
♪ A thousand years have flowed by ♪

25:20.250 --> 25:22.440
♪ Turning into tears
that brim over my eyes ♪

25:23.890 --> 25:26.040
♪ And the moonlight to heal sorrow ♪

25:27.280 --> 25:30.130
♪ The sweetness of the world
always tastes like the first time ♪

25:31.240 --> 25:34.260
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

25:35.470 --> 25:37.830
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

25:39.260 --> 25:41.540
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

25:42.640 --> 25:44.880
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

25:46.150 --> 25:49.250
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

25:50.220 --> 25:52.790
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

25:53.580 --> 25:56.890
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

25:57.900 --> 26:00.150
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

26:01.220 --> 26:04.280
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

26:04.640 --> 26:06.730
You've gone to such lengths to comfort me.

26:05.390 --> 26:07.980
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

26:08.360 --> 26:09.630
If I don't pull myself together,

26:08.670 --> 26:12.000
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

26:10.450 --> 26:12.180
wouldn't I be letting you down?

26:13.160 --> 26:18.410
♪ We forsake three lifetimes of marriage,
only to fulfill our wishes ♪

26:39.970 --> 26:42.780
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

26:43.850 --> 26:46.490
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

26:47.620 --> 26:50.090
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

26:51.470 --> 26:53.470
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

26:54.610 --> 26:57.700
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

26:55.190 --> 26:56.790
But in this chaotic world,

26:58.720 --> 27:01.280
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

26:58.770 --> 27:01.340
how am I to protect you
in the days to come?

27:01.940 --> 27:05.360
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

27:06.460 --> 27:08.630
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

27:09.790 --> 27:13.050
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

27:13.930 --> 27:16.520
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

27:17.270 --> 27:20.620
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

27:21.960 --> 27:27.250
♪ Giving up three lives of marriage
just for ♪

27:24.170 --> 27:31.700
[Tomb of Late Feiyu Guard Lu Tong]

27:31.480 --> 27:33.810
♪ Our wishes ♪

27:36.470 --> 27:37.160
Brother.

27:40.790 --> 27:41.830
I'm back.

27:44.590 --> 27:45.790
I, Pianpian, am back.

28:14.000 --> 28:14.790
Now,

28:17.130 --> 28:19.930
can you tell me what happened
when my brother died?

28:29.210 --> 28:32.850
[A few years ago]

28:37.070 --> 28:38.070
This is the place.

28:48.630 --> 28:50.390
Lu Tong, have you confirmed

28:50.530 --> 28:52.680
that the mountain demon
is indeed hiding here for cultivation?

28:52.680 --> 28:53.510
Sir,

28:53.830 --> 28:55.310
I've been staking out here for a month.

28:55.310 --> 28:57.240
That mountain demon goes out
to eat people during the day

28:57.240 --> 28:59.030
and returns to the courtyard at night
for cultivation.

28:59.030 --> 29:00.960
It's been dwelling here for years.

29:02.720 --> 29:03.360
Alright.

29:03.920 --> 29:04.400
Listen.

29:05.510 --> 29:07.440
Two of you, guard the front
and back doors.

29:07.440 --> 29:08.300
The rest of you,

29:08.350 --> 29:09.150
come in with me

29:09.310 --> 29:10.830
and set up the Eight Yang Formation.

29:10.830 --> 29:11.470
Qin Ge,

29:11.720 --> 29:12.660
you guard the front door.

29:12.660 --> 29:13.110
Yes.

29:13.200 --> 29:13.730
Bingzhu,

29:14.070 --> 29:14.980
you guard this door.

29:14.980 --> 29:15.400
Got it.

29:15.920 --> 29:17.690
If the mountain demon returns early,

29:17.690 --> 29:18.550
warn us at once.

29:18.590 --> 29:19.320
Understood.

29:19.830 --> 29:20.360
Let's go.

30:12.680 --> 30:13.800
Demons...

30:14.550 --> 30:16.350
They're all demons...

30:17.590 --> 30:18.250
Commander!

30:18.440 --> 30:20.680
They're all demons!

30:30.640 --> 30:31.240
Lu!

30:32.110 --> 30:32.930
Lu!

30:34.790 --> 30:35.680
Lu...

31:07.190 --> 31:10.430
Lu, these are our comrades
we spend every day with.

31:10.450 --> 31:12.650
How could you bring yourself to do this?

31:17.950 --> 31:18.820
Tan'er!

31:36.510 --> 31:37.500
It's useless.

31:38.240 --> 31:40.190
My heart is long gone.

31:40.290 --> 31:41.660
You beast!

31:55.750 --> 31:57.520
You're actually a demon!

31:58.160 --> 32:00.030
Truly, when brother and sister
work together,

32:00.030 --> 32:02.110
there's nothing they cannot achieve.

32:02.110 --> 32:02.920
Bingzhu,

32:04.440 --> 32:06.270
you have a great sister.

32:06.790 --> 32:07.480
Lu Tong.

32:08.740 --> 32:10.420
You once told me

32:11.060 --> 32:12.860
that you also have a kind sister,

32:13.510 --> 32:14.590
and you only joined the Feiyu Guards

32:14.590 --> 32:16.120
to avenge her!

32:16.400 --> 32:18.790
Why are you willing to become a demon now?

32:24.030 --> 32:25.830
My sister is still alive.

32:27.000 --> 32:29.000
She fell into Spirit's hands.

32:29.830 --> 32:31.430
I promised to work for Spirit

32:32.560 --> 32:34.450
and give her 100 young girls

32:34.480 --> 32:36.540
in exchange for Pianpian's freedom.

32:36.960 --> 32:39.210
To trade 100 innocent lives

32:40.030 --> 32:41.950
for your sister's freedom—

32:42.920 --> 32:44.720
do you think she would want that?

32:48.000 --> 32:49.930
Pianpian doesn't know about this.

32:50.720 --> 32:51.960
Spirit took my heart

32:52.820 --> 32:54.420
and replaced it with a stone.

32:54.590 --> 32:56.050
She said that from then on,

32:56.400 --> 32:58.660
I would be free of desires

32:58.720 --> 32:59.750
and invincible.

33:01.680 --> 33:03.400
Yet, I still failed.

33:04.200 --> 33:06.000
I was defeated by you siblings.

33:11.920 --> 33:13.640
Take my stone heart

33:13.830 --> 33:15.830
and present it as your achievement.

33:25.110 --> 33:25.880
Bingzhu.

33:27.920 --> 33:29.850
If you ever meet Pianpian,

33:30.540 --> 33:32.470
please take good care of her for me.

33:34.830 --> 33:38.550
I've never given up on saving her.

34:00.960 --> 34:02.490
Ten people went out,

34:02.790 --> 34:04.550
and only one rookie came back.

34:07.750 --> 34:09.949
Not only have we suffered heavy losses,

34:09.949 --> 34:11.949
but you didn't catch a single demon.

34:13.960 --> 34:15.420
Why did you even come back?

34:31.800 --> 34:32.710
My Lord.

34:34.320 --> 34:36.780
Actually, I didn't come back empty-handed.

34:50.800 --> 34:51.590
Good.

34:52.960 --> 34:55.920
At least we have something
to report to His Majesty.

34:58.440 --> 34:59.590
Your entire team, except for you,

34:59.590 --> 35:00.510
is dead,

35:01.150 --> 35:03.300
but we can't afford to lose
the salary allocated per head

35:03.300 --> 35:04.500
from the higher-ups.

35:04.770 --> 35:05.970
Here's what we'll do:

35:06.000 --> 35:07.660
quickly replenish your team.

35:07.840 --> 35:08.920
From now on,

35:09.590 --> 35:11.520
you'll be the captain of this team.

35:20.070 --> 35:21.130
Are you the only one

35:22.590 --> 35:24.230
who knows about this?

35:28.230 --> 35:29.940
All our men who died that day

35:32.050 --> 35:33.170
are buried here.

35:46.070 --> 35:47.480
Thank you for preserving

35:48.300 --> 35:49.470
my brother's honor.

35:59.110 --> 36:00.240
Where are you going?

36:06.010 --> 36:07.660
It doesn't matter anymore.

36:13.110 --> 36:15.770
I'm about to enter the palace
to see His Majesty.

36:16.550 --> 36:19.610
Since I've failed His Majesty's trust
on this journey,

36:19.910 --> 36:21.180
this palace visit

36:22.220 --> 36:23.910
may end in my demise.

36:31.230 --> 36:32.690
This is the key to my house,

36:34.670 --> 36:37.360
and all the savings I've accumulated
over the years

36:37.360 --> 36:40.220
are hidden at the southeast corner
of my courtyard.

36:41.000 --> 36:42.400
Go wait for me at my house.

36:42.840 --> 36:44.110
If I still haven't returned

36:44.110 --> 36:45.550
by 11 PM,

36:47.320 --> 36:48.190
take the money

36:48.770 --> 36:50.300
and leave as fast as you can.

36:52.040 --> 36:53.500
As for Lu's entrustment,

36:55.510 --> 36:57.030
this is all I can do.

36:59.000 --> 37:00.350
Do you really have to go?

37:03.930 --> 37:06.160
I must stay true to my principles.

37:20.140 --> 37:21.800
I've always had nowhere to go.

37:23.200 --> 37:24.660
Whether in the human realm

37:25.540 --> 37:28.270
or in the Realm of Mist and Void,
it's all the same.

37:29.320 --> 37:31.320
If you must follow your principles,

37:32.900 --> 37:34.480
then I'll guard your house

37:35.710 --> 37:37.110
and wait for your return.

37:53.890 --> 37:55.610
If I truly can't make it back,

37:56.600 --> 37:57.750
I have to trouble you

37:59.110 --> 38:00.710
to take care of Tan'er for me.

38:08.040 --> 38:09.040
Please talk to her

38:11.000 --> 38:13.160
and try to get her to
let go of her obsessions

38:13.160 --> 38:16.360
and enter the cycle of reincarnation
as soon as possible.

38:28.620 --> 38:30.350
I, the guilty subject Bingzhu,

38:30.510 --> 38:32.150
have failed Your Majesty's grace!

38:32.150 --> 38:34.150
I await Your Majesty's punishment!

38:43.150 --> 38:44.580
Guilty subject Bingzhu.

38:52.040 --> 38:55.170
You were tasked with
eliminating demons for the people,

38:55.230 --> 38:57.070
yet you secretly harbored evil beings,

38:57.070 --> 38:58.930
allowing them to harm the people.

38:59.700 --> 39:00.960
You deceived for fame

39:00.960 --> 39:02.560
and harmed your colleagues.

39:04.320 --> 39:06.070
His Majesty will surely
examine this matter thoroughly

39:06.070 --> 39:07.330
and spare no leniency.

39:09.250 --> 39:11.380
The guilty subject Bingzhu will now be

39:11.720 --> 39:13.330
thrown into the Imperial Prison

39:13.330 --> 39:15.190
and executed on an appointed day!

39:15.630 --> 39:17.070
Though I have failed in my duties,

39:17.070 --> 39:18.880
there are reasons for what happened!

39:18.880 --> 39:20.400
I only request to see His Majesty

39:20.400 --> 39:22.130
so I could apologize in person!

39:25.190 --> 39:26.110
Apologize?

39:27.280 --> 39:28.960
His Majesty only wants the Yuli Spring,

39:28.960 --> 39:30.360
not your apologies.

39:31.590 --> 39:34.120
After extensive searching,
the Feiyu Guards

39:34.280 --> 39:37.080
have obtained the spring water
from Mount Tianyu.

39:38.250 --> 39:40.980
His Majesty is currently
taking it for his health

39:41.070 --> 39:44.000
and has no time to care about
your excuses.

39:44.070 --> 39:46.320
The Kunlun Mirror is not yet complete.

39:46.340 --> 39:48.800
How could you have obtained
the Yuli Spring?

39:53.230 --> 39:56.190
You dare to present fake spring water
as a tribute?

39:56.480 --> 39:57.150
Ji Yan,

39:57.480 --> 39:59.210
you are deceiving His Majesty!

40:00.000 --> 40:01.800
Deceiving me?

40:03.150 --> 40:06.510
But it seems to me that
the one deceiving me is you, Bingzhu.

40:06.510 --> 40:07.400
Your Majesty!

40:11.280 --> 40:13.320
Do you recognize this person?

40:14.190 --> 40:15.260
Of course we do.

40:15.630 --> 40:16.440
Your Majesty,

40:16.880 --> 40:17.840
the one who harmed us

40:17.840 --> 40:19.030
is exactly this Bingzhu.
